ent. Emphasize the importance of regular follow-ups and support groups. RTC in 3-6 months.\n\n--- 01/06/2024 Office Visit ---\nS: Follow-up on opioid use disorder. Mr. Gibson reports continued abstinence from heroin and no cravings.\nO: BP 118/86, Wt 148 lb. General examination: WNL. No signs of withdrawal or intoxication.\nA: Opioid use disorder - unchanged.\nP: Continue current treatment. Encourage ongoing participation in addiction support programs. RTC in 3-6 months.\n\n--- 09/01/2023 Office Visit ---\nS: Follow-up on opioid use disorder. Mr. Gibson reports no recent use of heroin and is adhering to his treatment p"
